  <result type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved</narrative>
    <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats atteints</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats atteints</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Parmi les r&#xe9;sultats obtenus jusqu&apos;en mars 2022 : 1) consult&#xe9; 2690 personnes (dont 874, ou 32 % des femmes) lors des s&#xe9;ances de dialogue, d&#x2019;ateliers, de rencontres institutionnelles et d&#x2019;entretiens individuels; 2) 54 femmes ont mis en &#x153;uvre 14 initiatives communautaires de paix dans les r&#xe9;gions de Gao, Kayes, Mopti et Tombouctou.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved as of March 2022 include: (1) consulted 2,690 people (874, or 32% women) during dialogue sessions, workshops, institutional meetings and one-on one meetings; and (2) 54 women implemented 14 community peace initiatives in the Gao, Kayes, Mopti and Tombouctou regions.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
  </result>
  <result type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expected Results</narrative>
    <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results expected</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Les r&#xe9;sultats attendus de ce projet comprennent : 1) r&#xe9;duction des tensions, particuli&#xe8;rement celles impliquant les femmes, et pr&#xe9;vention des conflits dans les r&#xe9;gions de Gao, Tombouctou et Mopti; 2) renforcement des relations afin d&#x2019;am&#xe9;liorer la coh&#xe9;sion sociale dans le Nord du Mali; et 3) renforcement des m&#xe9;canismes et capacit&#xe9;s de gestion inclusive et participative de la s&#xe9;curit&#xe9;.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected outcomes of this project include: (1) reduced tensions, especially those affecting women, and prevention of conflicts in the regions of Gao, Timbuktu and Mopti; (2) stronger relationships that improve social cohesion in northern Mali; and (3) enhanced mechanisms and capacity for inclusive and participatory management of security.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
  </result>
